    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Play Unlog, our very first game !</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/bbeb125a8edc2807ad80c22099f52f79.poster.avif?t=1753394903\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/bbeb125a8edc2807ad80c22099f52f79.webm?t=1753394903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Master your movements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, <strong>wall jump</strong> and <strong>dash</strong> across this dream factory to escape ! These actions can be <strong>used in many contexts</strong> to gain speed and believe us... <strong>you will need speed</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/44b1afce09492bd6c5a6f1fdf3136807.poster.avif?t=1753394903\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/44b1afce09492bd6c5a6f1fdf3136807.webm?t=1753394903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the dream factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YoU'rE nOt WelComE HEre !</strong> <br>The factory is filled with <strong>obstacles</strong>, <strong>traps</strong> and we heard <strong>something guards the exit</strong> so be sure to be ready !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/8e6a25e714bc1aa3572be4a7a5072973.poster.avif?t=1753394903\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/8e6a25e714bc1aa3572be4a7a5072973.webm?t=1753394903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make this place your playground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlog is <strong>4\u00a0level-long</strong> but you can find <strong>a timer and a scoreboard</strong> to push your limits and maybe beat our own high score...\u00a0<br> <strong>2:30 min</strong> to complete the all game. <strong>Are you up to the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Play Unlog, our very first game !</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/bbeb125a8edc2807ad80c22099f52f79.poster.avif?t=1753394903\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/bbeb125a8edc2807ad80c22099f52f79.webm?t=1753394903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Master your movements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, <strong>wall jump</strong> and <strong>dash</strong> across this dream factory to escape ! These actions can be <strong>used in many contexts</strong> to gain speed and believe us... <strong>you will need speed</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/44b1afce09492bd6c5a6f1fdf3136807.poster.avif?t=1753394903\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/44b1afce09492bd6c5a6f1fdf3136807.webm?t=1753394903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the dream factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YoU'rE nOt WelComE HEre !</strong> <br>The factory is filled with <strong>obstacles</strong>, <strong>traps</strong> and we heard <strong>something guards the exit</strong> so be sure to be ready !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/8e6a25e714bc1aa3572be4a7a5072973.poster.avif?t=1753394903\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570210/extras/8e6a25e714bc1aa3572be4a7a5072973.webm?t=1753394903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make this place your playground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlog is <strong>4\u00a0level-long</strong> but you can find <strong>a timer and a scoreboard</strong> to push your limits and maybe beat our own high score...\u00a0<br> <strong>2:30 min</strong> to complete the all game. <strong>Are you up to the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
